# Context filter for web/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
#
# ALLOWLIST: deny everything, then re-include only what the image needs. The
# repo root is the operator's career-ops data root — cv.md, data/, reports/,
# config/profile.yml, portals.yml, documents/, .env — and a denylist that
# forgets one new file leaks it into a registry. Add paths here deliberately.

*

# career-ops code root used by the hirecute worker
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tracker-aliases.json
!*.mjs
!lib
!providers
!templates
!modes

# User-layer files that live inside modes/ (DATA_CONTRACT.md)
modes/_profile.md
modes/_custom.md
modes/_brief.md

# The web app
!web
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/.next-*
web/.env
web/.env.*
web/tests
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
web/Dockerfile
web/Dockerfile.dockerignore

# Anywhere
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
